OL,3,GNEWSALegionnaires' disease: Key
OL,4,Aquestions after outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deaths of two people after
OL,7,Fcontracting Legionnaires' disease in
OL,8,FSouth Yorkshire has led to people in
OL,9,Fthe region and beyond seeking more
OL,10,Finformation about the lung infection
OL,11,Fand its causes.
OL,13,FLittle has been released about the
OL,14,Fcases in Rotherham so far, but here is
OL,15,Fa basic guide covering some of the most
OL,16,Fcommon questions:
OL,18,FThe bacterium, Legionella, got its name
OL,19,Fafter pneumonia-like symptoms were seen
OL,20,Fin those attending a military
OL,21,Fconvention at a hotel in the United
OL,22,FStates in 1976.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
